{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Moses told his father-in-law.</b> To draw his heart to bring him near to the Torah (Mekhilta)." "<b>All the hardship.</b> That of the sea and that of Amalek." "<b>The hardship.</b> The alef is of the root of the word, and the tav is a form and root-element falling from it in inflected forms; and likewise תְּרוּמָה, תְּנוּפָה, תְּקוּמָה, תְּנוּאָה."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:56.212730399Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}